        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "5fa73a24-c5b5-52f3-9f93-67430017830a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Saturn AL-31, Chengdu J-10\n- Companies: Saturn, Chengdu Aircraft Corporation\n- Organizations: People's Liberation Army Air Force\n- Places: China\n- Concepts: military turbofan engines, multirole fighter aircraft, delta wing, canard design, fly-by-wire, all-weather operation\n\nFacts:\n- The Saturn AL-31 is a family of military turbofan engines.\n- The Saturn AL-31 currently powers all Su-27 derivatives and the Chengdu J-10 multirole jet fighter.\n- China developed the Chengdu J-10 multirole jet fighter.\n- The Chengdu J-10, NATO reporting name Firebird, is a lightweight multirole fighter aircraft capable of all-weather operation.\n- The Chengdu J-10 uses a delta wing and canard configuration with fly-by-wire flight controls.\n- Chengdu Aircraft Corporation in the People's Republic of China produces the Chengdu J-10 for the People's Liberation Army Air Force.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
